VALUES (2, 3, 'Augmentin 625 Duo', 'Amoxicillin and Potassium Clavulanate Tablets IP', 'Broad-Spectrum Antibiotic', 'GlaxoSmithKline Pharmaceuticals', 'Tablet', '625 mg (500mg + 125mg)', '[{"name": "Amoxicillin Trihydrate IP equivalent to Amoxicillin", "strength": "500", "unit": "mg", "purpose": "Antibacterial"}, {"name": "Potassium Clavulanate Diluted IP eq. to Clavulanic Acid", "strength": "125", "unit": "mg", "purpose": "Beta-lactamase Inhibitor"}]', '["Microcrystalline Cellulose", "Sodium Starch Glycolate", "Colloidal Silicon Dioxide", "Magnesium Stearate", "Titanium Dioxide", "Hypromellose"]', 'Oval biconvex', 'Off-white to pale yellow', 'None', 'Film-coated', 'Bacterial infections of the respiratory tract, ear-nose-throat, skin, and urinary tract.', '1 tablet twice daily at the start of a meal to minimize gastrointestinal discomfort.', 'Complete full prescribed course. Contraindicated in patients with penicillin hypersensitivity.', 'Diarrhea, nausea, vomiting, abdominal cramp, candida overgrowth.', 'Store protected from moisture below 25°C. Keep blister sealed until use.', 'Schedule H1 (Prescription Required)', 'Augmentin 625 Duo antibiotic tablet. Contains Amoxicillin and Clavulanate. Take one tablet twice daily with food. Complete the full antibiotic course.', 'ऑगमेंटिन 625 डुओ एंटीबायोटिक टैबलेट। भोजन के साथ दिन में दो बार लें। डॉक्टर द्वारा बताया गया पूरा कोर्स खत्म करें।', 'ऑगमेंटिन 625 डुओ अँटीबायोटिक गोळी. जेवणासोबत दिवसातून दोन वेळा घ्या. डॉक्टरांनी सांगितलेला पूर्ण कोर्स पूर्ण करा.', 'active')
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
