VALUES (25, 1, 'Allegra 120', 'Fexofenadine Hydrochloride Tablets IP', 'Non-drowsy Antihistamine', 'Sanofi India', 'Tablet', '120 mg', '[{"name": "Fexofenadine HCl IP", "strength": "120", "unit": "mg", "purpose": "H1 Receptor Antagonist"}]', '["Microcrystalline Cellulose", "Starch", "Povidone", "Magnesium Stearate", "Purified Talc"]', 'Round biconvex', 'White', 'None', 'Film-coated', 'Seasonal allergy, runny nose, and itchy skin hives.', 'Take 1 tablet once daily with water. Avoid fruit juices.', 'Take only as directed by your physician or pharmacist. Keep out of reach of children.', 'Consult package leaflet for full clinical side effects list.', 'Store below 25°C.', 'Schedule H', 'Allegra 120, generic Fexofenadine Hydrochloride Tablets IP 120 mg. Used for Seasonal allergy, runny nose, and itchy skin hives.. Take 1 tablet once daily with water. Avoid fruit juices.', 'Allegra 120, जेनेरिक Fexofenadine Hydrochloride Tablets IP 120 mg। Seasonal allergy, runny nose, and itchy skin hives.। खुराक: Take 1 tablet once daily with water. Avoid fruit juices.।', 'Allegra 120, जेनेरिक औषध Fexofenadine Hydrochloride Tablets IP 120 mg. Seasonal allergy, runny nose, and itchy skin hives.. डोस: Take 1 tablet once daily with water. Avoid fruit juices..', 'active')
